      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise Dr. Williams and the veterinary technicians for their warm bedside manner, thorough checkups, and swift emergency interventions. While most clients feel well supported, a few visitors expressed frustration following clinic management changes and inconsistent communication."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective treatments and urgent care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients commend the hospital for successful treatments ranging from life-saving emergency surgery for pyometra to ongoing diabetes management and dental cleanings. Dog and cat owners report noticeable recoveries, though one client sought a second opinion after an initial respiratory check."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Thorough explanations alongside communication lapses"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous reviewers appreciate detailed explanations regarding diagnostic tests, treatment options, and cost estimates before procedures begin. Conversely, dissatisfied clients report unreturned follow-up emails and a lack of prior notice when veterinary practice leadership changed hands."
      }
    }
  ],
